---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import MainHero from "./_components/MainHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <MainHero/>

  <main>

    <section class="wrapper component-markdown">
      <h2 class="sr-only">About me</h2>

      <p>
        Versatile software developer with a strong foundation in <strong>Java</strong> and a curiosity that drives me to explore new technologies across the entire stack. Whether it’s <strong>backend
        architecture, frontend UX, or DevOps</strong>, I thrive on learning and adapting to new challenges. </p>
      <p>
        I enjoy building tools and applications to improve workflows and experiment with emerging tech. A firm believer in <strong>clean code and software design patterns</strong>, I prioritize
        maintainability and efficiency in every project. </p>
      <p>
        Comfortable working independently yet highly collaborative, I excel at <strong>leading teams, mentoring developers, and delivering high- quality software</strong>. Always eager to step outside
        my comfort zone and push the boundaries of what I can create. </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
